Translation patch: spqr::encode_state_pb, spqr::decode_state_pb (new)

Change: adds two private wrappers, `encode_state_pb` (`PqRatchetState::encode_to_vec`) and
`decode_state_pb` (`PqRatchetState::decode`), through which all prost encoding and decoding of the
ratchet state is routed (see the patches for `initial_state`, `send`, `recv`, `decode_state`).
Why: both wrappers are opaque in the translation, so no translated code reaches the
prost-derived `Message` impls, whose translation Aeneas gets wrong (#102, aeneas#1046).
Behaviour: identical.

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
index 6bc0197..ec39ad3 100644
--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -47,6 +47,14 @@ pub fn empty_state() -> SerializedState {
     SerializedState::new()
 }
 
+fn encode_state_pb(state_pb: &pqrpb::PqRatchetState) -> Vec<u8> {
+    state_pb.encode_to_vec()
+}
+
+fn decode_state_pb(bytes: &[u8]) -> Result<pqrpb::PqRatchetState, prost::DecodeError> {
+    pqrpb::PqRatchetState::decode(bytes)
+}
